/*
INSTRUCTIONS:
1. Go to the Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/).
2. Create a new project or select an existing one.
3. Enable the "YouTube Data API v3".
4. Go to "Credentials" and create new "OAuth client ID" credentials.
5. Select "Desktop app" as the application type.
6. Click "Create".
7. Click the "Download JSON" button to download your client secrets file.
8. Rename the downloaded file to "client_secret.json" and place it in the root directory of this project, overwriting this file.
